Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.05,0:00:21.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宇宙海盗哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了，瑞蒂？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.30,0:02:07.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和多明尼克分手到现在正好整整一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.50,0:02:10.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也觉得她很迷人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.58,0:02:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么？还想见她吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.06,0:02:18.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是银河警察的中尉，而我是被重金悬赏的海盗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.38,0:02:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再怎么迷恋她也无法约会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:24.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到挺有自知之明的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之太无聊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.62,0:02:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要看看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.58,0:02:37.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是刚才收的新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.74,0:02:48.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个月前金星派往地球的运金船\N维纳斯号途中失去消息至今仍然下落不明
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当局推测可能是意外撞上陨石
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.58,0:02:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但因为金块的数量过于庞大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:03:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故银河警察已经介入调查
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:05.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是事故吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.22,0:03:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多半是被基尔顿给抢走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.90,0:03:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就会知道你会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.58,0:03:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道是基尔顿干的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.14,0:03:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是眼镜蛇哥普拉，我的直觉一向十分准确
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:19.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂去拉斯维加斯太空站吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.66,0:03:22.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉斯维加斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:23.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错，拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:25.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.70,0:03:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第十三话 死亡的轮盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:54.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闻到了 闻到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.86,0:03:56.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是黄金的香味
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里真是跟维纳斯号的金块有关吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是的老大叫铁锤 保路多 乔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.18,0:04:12.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁锤 保路多 乔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实他也是基尔顿的干部之一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:24.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再加上这里是运金船的必经之路
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都联想不到的也只有傻瓜和银河警察了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:31.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克听到的话可是会生气的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找到金块后打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:38.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还用说 当然是代表地球政府收下来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:41.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得真好听
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.22,0:04:53.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是好怀念啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:56.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实你不过是想到赌场玩而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.50,0:05:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别追根究底嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然都到这里来了，多少玩上一把
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是海盗哥普拉的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:08.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里玩上一把
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂你到仓库区调查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:10.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:14.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑色26
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:23.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:27.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,客人，请问您要什么饮料？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.38,0:05:32.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来杯马蒂尼怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.82,0:05:35.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.18,0:05:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请慢慢享用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:44.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么好的女孩在赌场做太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.78,0:05:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们故意把脚伸出来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:06:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 开玩笑而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.18,0:06:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑！可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭婆娘！对你客气还不知好歹！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭婆娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.50,0:06:15.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可恶了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:16.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:19.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:22.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:31.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真走运啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:33.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中了大笔金币了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.62,0:06:43.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那女人昨晚在仓库现身的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:48.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她旁边的男人是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.38,0:06:50.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.82,0:06:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是生面孔 看就知道是想英雄救美的笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要抓起来拷问吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.70,0:06:59.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉那个女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:01.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可疑的家伙一律都要杀死
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:03.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁锤 保路多 乔的风格
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住！再走就开枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.98,0:07:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里做确实会遇到讨厌的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是也有很多有意思的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.78,0:07:59.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:03.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你的招待
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:05.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再留一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.14,0:08:07.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这样会被骂的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:10.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会被骂的 是在招待客人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:11.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你小费吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:13.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我太开心了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才你说的有意思的事情是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.26,0:08:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢四处探险
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个太空站你也有四处探险吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:30.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.56,0:08:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…你有去过仓库吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.26,0:08:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仓库？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.46,0:08:44.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在仓库里有没有看到挂有这种奇怪的标帜船？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:57.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉，接过下！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:08:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借我一用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.94,0:08:59.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:39.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然是机械人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.92,0:09:40.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可恶了，骗人的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要退钱！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.86,0:09:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.18,0:09:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全弄不明白！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:54.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事 没事 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:09:58.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:09:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:01.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个整容复活的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:05.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我亲眼看见他的左手是枪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:07.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且发射的能源弹还会转弯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找遍全宇宙也找不出第二人了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.70,0:10:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:18.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才在仓库发现发现有可疑的女机械人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:20.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在该怎么办才好？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:22.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:23.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:51.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红色8号
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维纳斯号
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉斯维加斯太空站果然是基尔顿的基地
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信好强的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:26.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然能把我的超合金身体轻易扎成豆沙包了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.80,0:12:46.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖的留在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:51.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是铁锤 保路多 乔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:01.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要快点通知哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:09.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了，小兔子要乖乖呆在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.32,0:13:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该去和瑞蒂联络了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂！瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:33.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答我，瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是发生意外了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:42.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来只好直接去找乔了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.04,0:13:44.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样决定！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:03.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.72,0:14:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别出声否则扭断你的脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的腕力有五百公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.96,0:14:53.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我去找你的老大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.64,0:14:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:15:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心我只是想和他谈话而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:08.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没到啊 你就忍耐一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:29.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎！哥普拉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:40.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到你真高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是铁锤 保路多 乔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:47.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你不请我吃午饭的呢，真是没有意思啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.28,0:15:52.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得来么赌场 你就好好享受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.60,0:15:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就先玩玩死亡游戏吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:08.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样，哥普拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这轮盘怎么样，哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:11.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:15.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赌你会死在黑色的2上！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.28,0:16:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赌注就是维纳斯号的全部金块吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.56,0:16:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是遗憾，你是输了，乔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.68,0:17:22.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是能打倒水晶人的人物 哥普拉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.88,0:17:25.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜你打不破这强化玻璃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.68,0:17:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的光线和红外线都不能穿透这玻璃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是近距离用45密林弹也无法击穿它
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:43.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别白费力气了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.36,0:17:55.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你忘了我是怎么样打倒水晶人的了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:18:00.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管那个家伙的身体是多么的坚固 结果还是被打败
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.68,0:18:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了，我的拍档瑞蒂失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有看到她？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:08.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是麻烦啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.56,0:18:15.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.48,0:18:20.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:23.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么又跟来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.84,0:18:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为看起来好有意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是间谍啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:29.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.20,0:18:31.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢这种的了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊，心中小鹿乱撞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:34.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好想哭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼还在磨蹭些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂，住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不快点的话坏蛋会逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:42.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:18:58.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来藏在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.72,0:19:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到这里的老板是个大富翁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:08.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好羡慕！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:10.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是少了一块也没人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:12.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行不行，不可以当小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好不要有这样的邪念
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:18.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就是你的葬身之所
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:25.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来，坏蛋到底跑到哪里去了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到那边去找找看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:40.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那手臂到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.68,0:19:45.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,左拳强攻，右拳从低处向上攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:53.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:56.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是他被称为铁拳乔的理由？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:14.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.12,0:20:23.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小兔子小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:24.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听得到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:25.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:27.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来的地方有配电装置
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快点把重力控制给关掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:31.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:34.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到此为止了，哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.00,0:21:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了，铁锤 保路多 乔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点回来！右拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.24,0:21:06.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了，左拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:10.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫了没用
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次换我来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:17.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下，哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.68,0:21:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.96,0:21:42.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宇宙又多了一颗新卫星
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都结束了 哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.60,0:21:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我忘了一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.28,0:21:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没问小姐的芳名
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.48,0:22:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是银河警察秘密调查部的露西亚·洛得克中尉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.28,0:22:04.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中尉？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:06.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经和银河警察取得联络了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.68,0:22:08.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:09.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.86,0:22:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是有意骗你的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.56,0:22:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:16.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.36,0:22:19.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易逃出来你却…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.16,0:22:21.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊，瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:24.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是多明尼克的同僚 中尉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.56,0:22:28.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说要给我镀金的勋章来代替金块
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:34.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一次我一定先问名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.49,0:22:44.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 究竟发生什么事了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.59,0:22:47.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被魔王加鲁丹关起来的原来是个美女
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:50.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她感激我救了她
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.49,0:22:52.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加鲁丹是一个怪异的使用法术的老头
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:55.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对我施展了奇怪的术法
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.10,0:22:56.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然发生这样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.20,0:22:58.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还有气球种子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:22:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能和他硬拚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.80,0:23:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怎么办呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.04,0:23:03.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一集\N大魔王加鲁丹
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.74,0:23:05.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.97,0:00:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
